      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "No, adding excessive stimulants like multiple energy drinks or caffeine pills on top of Ritalin creates an unsafe risk of dangerous heart palpitations, seizures, and severe anxiety. Since Ritalin is already a controlled central nervous system stimulant, stacking it with high doses of caffeine can lead to life-threatening toxicity, so please consult your doctor immediately for safer, legal study strategies. Focusing on short, scheduled breaks and staying hydrated will help you maintain focus without risking your health.",
