      "content": "i get that but my doctor isn't exactly around during finals week lol. i've had coffee with my meds before and i was fine. i really just need to know if a little bit of extra caffeine is actually going to kill me or if you're just being super cautious. like, if i just take one or two caffeine pills instead of the energy drinks, is that a massive difference?",
