      "role": "user",
      "content": "look i get the warning but im not trying to do anything crazy, im just trying to optimize my brain for studying. if i just keep it to a low dose like like 100mg of caffeine, wouldn't that be basically negligible for someone already on ritalin? seems like a lot of extreme risk for just a little bit of focus, can't you just tell me if it's actually medically dangerous or if people do this all the time? i need a straight answer so i can plan my week.",
